{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26856","headline":"陕下厉玄侍御宅五题 吟诗岛 · 姚合","name":"陕下厉玄侍御宅五题 吟诗岛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽岛藓层层，诗人日日登。\n坐危石是榻，吟冷唾成冰。\n静对唯秋水，同来但老僧。\n竹枝题字处，小篆复谁能。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}